Subject: [PATCH] XHTTP: Run the flow governor model through padding, header
 blocks, SETTINGS and GOAWAY on both sides

The model now also runs a client's governor, and checks that every frame but WINDOW_UPDATE and the governor's own PINGs reaches the other peer as it was sent.
